  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>HI</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Gluconic acid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> water</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose pentacetate</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math> acetic anhydride</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Saccharic acid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Hexane</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
